* text=auto

# Patch files must stay byte-exact (LF) on EVERY platform. With `* text=auto`
# above, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites them LF->CRLF, and
# `git apply` then dies with "corrupt patch" on the zero-length blank context
# line (hit on lib/ext/cmsis/0001-iar-Add-missing-v8.1m-check.patch:19).
# -text = never EOL-normalize, so the byte-for-byte LF form is preserved.
*.patch -text

# Binary files that should not be normalized
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
